#===========================================================================
#                               display_pdc.rinit
#
#  DESCRIPTION:
#    This file contains init values for DISPLAY PDC
#
#    Settings are obtained from TCS contents sheet maintained by 
#    Architecture team alongwith collaboration from SW and HW teams.
#
